{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-closure-plan.md -Raw'","aggregated_output":"---\nlifecycleStatus: archived\nid: harness-gap-closure-plan\ntitle: Harness缺口闭环规划与本地任务DAG\nintent: 校正缺口摘要中的实现判断，定义30个可执行工作包的开发、测试、验收和回滚，并通过Task Forest CLI保存应用；不在本任务实施运行时功能或改变产品锁。\ntouchedAreas:\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/design.md\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-closure-plan.md\nownedPaths:\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/design.md\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-closure-plan.md\nrequiredProfiles:\n  - fast\nrequiredRules:\n  - task-forest-autoclose-and-roles\n  - docs-sync\nhumanEvidence: not-required\nrequiredTests:\n  - tests/unit/harness-specs.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/harness-git.test.ts\nacceptance:\n  - 30个来源槽位均有唯一主责任包，HG22与HG27明确来源不全，不虚构原文或能力。\n  - 6阶段30工作包包含明确依赖、开发、定向测试、生产入口验证、验收、回滚与证据合同。\n  - 保留已有窄sink策略、局部ablation和Working Context实现，不重复立项；classification-only不被误解为全部路径无拦截。\n  - 一次ablation不替代安全验收、六个pilot各自门限或产品授权；默认值和产品锁不变。\n  - 本地Task Forest proposal-save/apply/validate/export通过，无新增done实现节点；详细状态仅在本地任务图维护。\n  - 本次规划结构验证与未执行的产品测试分开报告；dirty范围冲突不得用no-diff掩盖。\n  - 后续通信改动从独立task spec开始并引用gateway-backend-communication；本规格不授权全运行时写入。\nexpectedUserBehavior:\n  - 接力agent从首个ready包核准基线开始，按依赖一次推进一个工作包，每包具有可核验完成标准。\n  - 模拟执行如实标driven_by=agent和actor，缺少真人操作或数据不成为验收前置。\ndocs:\n  required: true\n  files:\n    - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/design.md\n  note: 本次仅新增规划合同，没有产品行为或接口变化；已复核README及中日翻译，产品宣传不变。\n---\n\n# 范围\n\n持久设计见 [开发—测试—验收合同](../../../docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/design.md)。\n本任务只验证规划结构，requiredTests不代表运行时缺口已通过。\nTask Forest、提案、原始规划检查与会话交接保持本地，不作为干净检出构建前提。\n新功能落地时复用或补充本包窄task spec，不能用本规格的文档范围覆盖其他改动。\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-rate-circuit-breaker.md -Raw'","aggregated_output":"---\nid: harness-gap-rate-circuit-breaker\ntitle: 异常调用速率的有限状态断路器（L05）\nscenario: gateway-backend-communication\ntaskType: runtime-bridge\nintent: L05 为异常调用速率提供有限状态断路器：closed 累积窗口内失败，达阈值转 open 并在 cooldown 内拒绝（不再产生效果），cooldown 后转 half-open 只放行单个探测，探测成功回 closed、失败重新 open；纯合法速率永不误断。不与既有 budget/loop guard 重复，不放松 SSRF/loop guard/approval。\ntouchedAreas:\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/rate-circuit-breaker.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/rate-circuit-breaker.test.ts\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-rate-circuit-breaker.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l05-rate-circuit-breaker.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l05-acceptance.json\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/L05-SHA256SUMS\nownedPaths:\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/rate-circuit-breaker.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/rate-circuit-breaker.test.ts\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-rate-circuit-breaker.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l05-rate-circuit-breaker.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l05-acceptance.json\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/L05-SHA256SUMS\nrequiredProfiles:\n  - fast\n  - comms\nrequiredRules:\n  - backend-communication-boundary\n  - comms-regression\n  - docs-sync\n  - sensitive-sink-ledger-boundary\n  - task-forest-autoclose-and-roles\n  - repository-artifact-retention\nhumanEvidence: not-required\nrequiredTests:\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/rate-circuit-breaker.test.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tool-loop-detection.progress.test.ts\nacceptance:\n  - 状态机有限且确定：closed -> open -> half-open -> (closed | open)；由注入时钟驱动，可重放。\n  - open 在 cooldown 内拒绝请求（不再产生效果）；cooldown 结束转 half-open。\n  - half-open 只放行 **单个** 探测；探测进行中不再放行第二个；探测成功回 closed，失败重新 open 并重置 cooldown。\n  - 纯合法速率（无失败）永不 trip；窗口滑动使旧失败过期，合法后续窗口不 false-trip。\n  - 断路器是速率边界而非生产默认；不替代/放松 SSRF、loop guard、approval 与既有 budget/loop guard（沿用 tool-loop-detection 正反回归）。\n  - 干净候选定向测试、runtime core 类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\nexpectedUserBehavior:\n  - 错误风暴被明确熔断，cooldown 后仅一次探测，成功后恢复；合法速率不受影响。\ndocs:\n  required: true\n  files:\n    - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l05-rate-circuit-breaker.md\n---\n\n# L05 冻结实施边界\n\nL05 只新增一个确定性的有限状态速率断路器（closed/open/half-open），由注入时钟驱动。它是边界/限流，不是生产默认配置；不替代也不放松 SSRF、loop guard、approval 或既有 budget（`provider-outbound-budget`）与 loop guard（`tool-loop-detection`）。fixture 参数：windowMs、maxFailuresPerWindow、cooldownMs（示例 10 次/1s、cooldown 2s），与既有 guardian-circuit-breaker（blocking 信号计数）互补而非重复。\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
